{"id":"6381fcb11f72a6fe","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-fixed-marker-coding.md","title":"Fixed Computable Marker Coding","display":"df-fixed-marker-coding — Fixed Computable Marker Coding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-fixed-marker-coding","aliases":["68-df-fixed-marker-coding","68-df-sacks-coding-strategy"],"display":"df-fixed-marker-coding — Fixed Computable Marker Coding","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-recursive-function]]"],"source_location":"not located in supplied PDF; local fixed-marker coding interface","verification_status":"pending-sacks-mechanism","source_proof_status":"no-strategy-construction-provided","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"renamed_from":"68-df-sacks-coding-strategy","revision_basis":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-fixed-marker-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-fixed-marker-coding</span><span>68-df-sacks-coding-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fixed-marker-coding — Fixed Computable Marker Coding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"not located in supplied PDF; local fixed-marker coding interface"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-sacks-mechanism"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"no-strategy-construction-provided"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"renamed_from","html":"68-df-sacks-coding-strategy"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(C,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是候选固定标记函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksEncode}\">\\(\\mathrm{SacksEncode}\\)</span> 在此仅为固定有效标记编码接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SacksEncode}(C,A,p)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nA\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land p\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land\n\\forall e,f\\in\\mathbb N\\;(p(e)=p(f)\\Rightarrow e=f)\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(e\\in C\\Longleftrightarrow p(e)\\in A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SacksEncode}(C,A,p)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nA\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land p\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land\n\\forall e,f\\in\\mathbb N\\;(p(e)=p(f)\\Rightarrow e=f)\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(e\\in C\\Longleftrightarrow p(e)\\in A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补明固定标记的类型、有效性及互异性。若该条件成立，p 是 C 到 A 的单一可计算成员归约，故 C 本身也必须 c.e.；它不能用来无条件编码任意非 c.e. 集合。</p>\n<p>所给原书没有定位到名为 Sacks coding strategy 的完整机制。此节点仍只给固定标记编码的验收接口，没有移动标记、伤害后的恢复或许可条件，也没有构造存在性。历史文件名只作为别名保留，原谓词符号保持不变；不得把本接口等同于一般 Sacks 编码策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是候选固定标记函数。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 与 $\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-recursive-function]]。$\\mathrm{SacksEncode}$ 在此仅为固定有效标记编码接口。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是候选固定标记函数。$\\mathrm{RE}$ 与 $\\mathrm{TotalRec}$ 分别见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]、[[68-df-recursive-function]]。$\\mathrm{SacksEncode}$ 在此仅为固定有效标记编码接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"C,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksEncode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SacksEncode}(C,A,p)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nA\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land p\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\land\n\\forall e,f\\in\\mathbb N\\;(p(e)=p(f)\\Rightarrow e=f)\\land\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(e\\in C\\Longleftrightarrow p(e)\\in A).","display":true}],"bytes":1818,"backlinks":[{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-fixed-marker-coding|df-fixed-marker-coding — Fixed Computable Marker Coding]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-fixed-marker-coding]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[68-df-minimal-degree-tree]] 保留树验收定义；[[68-prop-minimal-degree-tree-characterization]] 只展开该定义，不构造见证。[[68-df-priority-true-path]] 按其实际内容归为阶段路径和真路径条件的定义，不作为方法存在性定理；[[68-df-fixed-marker-coding]] 与 [[68-df-finite-use-preservation]] 只提供各自明示的局部接口，不宣称完整 Sacks 策略。"}],"outgoing":["913d52943499d039","a82d826d433dcff3"]}